SUMMARY:Stand-Up Showcase
LOCATION:Washington
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy great stand-up comedy in downtown DC. Our showcase lineup
 s feature top talent from DC\, Maryland\, Virginia and beyond\, performing 
 on one of the country's most famous stages. You'll see a variety of styles 
 and get up close with some of the stars of tomorrow. Support local talent\,
  support local business and (most important) laugh your a** off. Showcases 
 generally last around 90 minutes.\n\nAugust 14-16 lineup: Dom Grayer\, Liam
  Nelson\, Dom Hatton-Woods\, Ty Colgate\n\nAugust 21-23 lineup: Kade Wonder
 s\, Garrett Harvest\, Aminah Imani\, Randy Syphax\, Jamal Russell\n\nAugust
  28-30 lineup: Dale Dunlap\, Ray Diva\, Matt Brown\, Stacey Axler\, Dom Gra
 yer\n\nAll sales are final. Refunds and exchanges are offered only when a s
 how is canceled or rescheduled.\n\nAdmission Policies\n\nPatrons must be 18
  or older to attend events or classes at the DC Improv. Any exceptions are 
 clearly noted in the event descriptions.\n\nThere is a two-item minimum per
  customer. This can be any combination of food items or beverages. Bottled 
 water and soft drinks count as items. (The two-item minimum does not apply 
 to comedy classes.)\n\nCoupons or passes for free admission cannot be used 
 for a show listed as a "special event."\n\nSeating Policies\n\nAll shows in
  our lounge showroom are seated by time of arrival. The earlier you arrive\
 , the more options you'll have. Please note that the size of your party can
  affect what options are available to you\, as certain tables and areas are
  designated for larger parties.\n\nFor general admission tickets\, if your 
 party does not fill an entire table\, you may be sharing a table with other
  patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/stand-up-s
 howcase-23862/
